<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Ba&#x0364;r</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
Oeconomi&#x017F;chen <hi rendition="#aq">Lexico</hi> ausfu&#x0364;hrlich<lb/>
