<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Baguette, V. Appui main.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Bahn,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein ebener richtiger gebahnter<lb/>
