<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Bai&#x017F;&#x017F;er,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Erniedrigen, niederla&#x017F;&#x017F;en; <hi rendition="#aq">en<lb/>
