</div><fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Bar</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Barbe,</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#fr">der Barbar, Barber,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>So nennet man die Pferde aus<lb/>
der Barbarey in Africa, welche<lb/>
