</div><fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Be&#x017F;</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Be&#x017F;chluß der Klang Re-<lb/>
de,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Peroratio,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Muß in der Mu&#x017F;ic vor allen an-<lb/>
