<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Biber,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Ca&#x017F;tor,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Es giebt Land- und Wa&#x017F;&#x017F;er-Bi-<lb/>
