<hi rendition="#aq">bizarr.</hi></p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Bizarrerie d&#x2019; un cheval,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Eigen&#x017F;innigkeit eines Pferds;<lb/>
