ner Kirche.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cantori&#x017F;&#x017F;a, Cantrix,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Eine Sa&#x0364;ngerin, das er&#x017F;te wird<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">aber</fw><lb/>
