Lu&#x017F;tga&#x0364;rten, Fe&#x017F;tungen &#xA75B;c.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cerataules, Ceraules,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein Horn- oder Zincken-Bla-<lb/>
&#x017F;er.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cercar della Nota,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein Suchen der Note, hei&#x017F;&#x017F;et,<lb/>
