<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cornetto,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein Zincke, de&#x017F;&#x017F;en Sprengel<lb/>
von dem unge&#x017F;trichenen a bis ins<lb/>
3 ge&#x017F;trichene c gehet.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cornetto curva,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein krummer Zincke.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Cornetto diritto,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
