<cb n="437"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Cou</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
Mausfalben &#xA75B;c. 3) Braun&#x017F;cha&#x0364;ckigt,<lb/>
