<fw type="sig" place="bottom">P 5</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">weiln</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0254"/>
<cb n="467"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Cro</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
weiln &#x017F;ie keine Lection mit einiger<lb/>
