<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Deloiauté, voyez Infidelité.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Demi-Air,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
