<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Diadromi,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Durchla&#x0364;uffer hei&#x017F;&#x017F;en in der Mu-<lb/>
&#x017F;ic 1) diejenigen Schwenckungen<lb/>
