<hi rendition="#aq">E&#x017F;aias Compenius</hi> ums Jahr 1590<lb/>
erfunden hat.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Dolce,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Oder <hi rendition="#aq">Dolcemente, con dolce<lb/>
