<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Embouchement,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Das Bla&#x017F;en mit dem Munde<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">in</fw><lb/>
