<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Encloüûre,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>J&#x017F;t eine Vernagelung der Pfer-<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">de,</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0324"/>
<cb n="607"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Enc</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
de, wenn der Nagel &#x017F;ich entwe-<lb/>
