<fw type="catch" place="bottom">nem</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0325"/>
<cb n="609"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">End</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
nem Pferde, welches in Rechten<lb/>
