<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Eques,</hi></hi> &#x017F;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Eque&#x017F;tres ludi,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Waren bey den Ro&#x0364;mern &#x017F;o viel<lb/>
