<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites Calatraven&#x017F;es,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Ritter von Calatrava &#x017F;ind<lb/>
Anno 1158 in Spanien wider die<lb/>
