<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites Chri&#x017F;ti,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Ritter Chri&#x017F;ti in Portugall,<lb/>
ent&#x017F;tanden Anno 1319, an &#x017F;tat der<lb/>
