<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites Chri&#x017F;tianæ militiæ,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Ritter <hi rendition="#aq">Chri&#x017F;tianæ Militiæ,</hi><lb/>
