<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites Columbani, v. Equi-<lb/>
tes Spiritus Sancti.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites Con&#x017F;tantiniani,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Con&#x017F;tantins-Ritter, welche<lb/>
