<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Equites divorum Co&#x017F;mæ<lb/>
&amp; Damiani,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Ritter Co&#x017F;ma&#x0364; und Dami-<lb/>
ani, trugen ein rothes Creutz, in<lb/>
de&#x017F;&#x017F;en Mitte die Bilder der heili-<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">gen</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0345"/>
<cb n="649"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Eqv</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
gen Ma&#x0364;rtyrer Co&#x017F;ina&#x0364; und Dami-<lb/>
