</div><fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Eul</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Etroit, conduire un cheval<lb/>
étroit,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
