Per&#x017F;onen, ob der&#x017F;elben viel oder<lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">B b 2</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">wenig</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0408"/>
<cb n="775"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Fig</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
