<fw type="catch" place="bottom">mager</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0415"/>
<cb n="789"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Fla</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
mager i&#x017F;t. <hi rendition="#aq">Cheval, qui a beau-<lb/>
