<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Flauta cu&#x017F;pida,</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#fr">&#x017F;. Spitz-<lb/>
Flo&#x0364;te.</hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Flauto, Flûte,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die gemeine oder Qvart-Flo&#x0364;te<lb/>
