<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Incentivum,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Das An&#x017F;timmen der Jn&#x017F;tru-<lb/>
mente, theils dadurch ho&#x0364;ren zu<lb/>
