<cb n="1203"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Kat</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
Ge&#x017F;tra&#x0364;uchern, wo das Geflu&#x0364;gel<lb/>
