<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Kinnbacken,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">v. Ganaches, it.</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#fr">Kiefer.</hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Kinn-Kette, Kinn-Reiff,</hi><lb/>
