<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Larigot,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>J&#x017F;t ein altes Wort, welches<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">ein</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0661"/>
<cb n="1281"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">La&#x017F;</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
