tel.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Latitudo &#x017F;oni,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Sta&#x0364;rcke eines Klanges,<lb/>
