<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Lavant,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Oder S. Andrea&#x0364;, eine Stadt<lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Ritter-</hi><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Lexic.</hi></hi> S &#x017F;</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">an</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0662"/>
<cb n="1283"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Lau</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
an dem Flu&#x017F;&#x017F;e Lavant in Nieder-<lb/>
