den, daß man ihnen die Rippen<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">vor</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0721"/>
<cb n="1401"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Mag</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
