den.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Mi&#x017F;cella acuta, v. Mixtura.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Mi&#x017F;erole,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>J&#x017F;t eine gewi&#x017F;&#x017F;e Art eines Na-<lb/>
