<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Organum pneumaticum,</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#fr">Orgel,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Beha&#x0364;lt unter allen mu&#x017F;icali-<lb/>
&#x017F;chen Jn&#x017F;trumenten den Vorzug,<lb/>
