<hi rendition="#aq">pas grave.</hi></p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas balancé,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Der Abwiegungs-Schritt, i&#x017F;t,<lb/>
wenn der Leib allemal <hi rendition="#aq">ad perpen-<lb/>
