<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas cha&#x017F;&#x017F;é, v. Cha&#x017F;&#x017F;é.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas contretems, v. Con-<lb/>
tretems.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas coulant, v. Fleuret.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas coupé, v. Coupé.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
