<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas de Courante, v. Courante.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pas demi-coupé, v. Demi-<lb/>
