&#x017F;tehen und widerhor&#x017F;tig machen.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Peiks,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Sind des Groß-Sultans <hi rendition="#aq">Pag</hi>en<lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">J i i 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">oder</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0890"/>
<cb n="1739"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Pel</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
oder Edelknaben, welche Mu&#x0364;tzen<lb/>
