<cb n="1740"/>
</div><fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Pen</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pen&#x017F;ée d&#x2019; un Chevalier,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die Gedancken, Einfall, Nach-<lb/>
&#x017F;innen. An einem Ritter wird<lb/>
