<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pentaphonium,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein fu&#x0364;nf-&#x017F;timmiges mu&#x017F;icali-<lb/>
&#x017F;ches Stu&#x0364;ck.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pentatonon,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Die <hi rendition="#aq">Sexta &#x017F;uperflua,</hi> weil &#x017F;ie<lb/>
