<fw type="sig" place="bottom">J i i 4</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">&#x017F;chnupf-</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0892"/>
<cb n="1743"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Per</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
&#x017F;chnupffen, und etwas in eine<lb/>
