<hi rendition="#aq">ob&#x017F;ervi</hi>ren &#xA75B;c.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Perfetto modo</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#fr">oder</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">tempo,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Deutet in der Mu&#x017F;ic den Tri-<lb/>
