</div><fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Pou</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Poudre à tirer,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
