in Gefahr kommen.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Prelude, Preludio, v. Præ-<lb/>
ludium.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Prendre en Gage,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Hei&#x017F;t einen pfa&#x0364;nden. Die<lb/>
