<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Quinquatrus minu&#x017F;culæ, &#x017F;.<lb/>
Quinquatria minora,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Das Fe&#x017F;t der Pfeiff-Weihung,<lb/>
