<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Ritter</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">du Pavillon,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Hat der ietzige Ko&#x0364;nig in Franck-<lb/>
