<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Ritter</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">de la Squama,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Lat. <hi rendition="#aq">Ordo crucem &#x017F;quamatam<lb/>
