der Medicin gebraucht.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Ru&#x0364;&#x017F;tung,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein beym Vogel-Stellen ge-<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">bra&#x0364;uch-</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f1026"/>
<cb n="2011"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Rum</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
bra&#x0364;uchliches Wort, begreifft alles<lb/>
dasjenige, was man bey einem<lb/>
