<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Schreyer-Pfeiffe,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Schryari,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Gehen &#x017F;tarck und fri&#x017F;ch an Laut,<lb/>
