<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Schritt,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pa&#x017F;&#x017F;us, Pas,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein gemeiner Schritt i&#x017F;t 2 Ko&#x0364;-<lb/>
