&#x017F;oll, 200 Ellen lang &#x017F;eyn.</p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Schritt,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">v. Pas.</hi></hi></head></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#fr">Schritt-Schuhe,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Sind gewi&#x017F;&#x017F;e platt ge&#x017F;chliffene<lb/>
