<hi rendition="#aq">c-cis.</hi></p></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Secutor,</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p>War eine Art von <hi rendition="#aq">Gladiatoribus,</hi><lb/>
