<fw type="sig" place="bottom">X x x 4</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">ten</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f1088"/>
<cb n="2127"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Si&#x017F;</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
ten Mittel-Schilde oben die Kay-<lb/>
