<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Te&#x017F;tudo</hi>,</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Ein mu&#x017F;icali&#x017F;ch Jn&#x017F;trument,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">Cheiys</hi> genannt, hatte 7 Saiten<lb/>
<cb n="2206"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Teu</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
